WEBVTT

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:08.880
It would seem...

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.330
that I died.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:20.000
But in another world,

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.830
I reincarnated as a young girl with cat ears...

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.420
No, I did not.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.210
I reincarnated as a sword.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.170
Episode 1 The Catgirl Met a Sword

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.880
I reincarnated as a sword.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.080
And,

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:49.120
this little catgirl is my wielder.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.500
Our meeting was by chance...

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.670
No.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:58.380
For us, it was a miracle beyond explanation.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:07.210
Huh? I'm dead, aren't I?

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:09.540
Wait... Is this...

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.420
Am I in another world?

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:13.210
There's something flying in the sky!

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:16.290
Hold on. Did I reincarnate

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.210
as a sword?

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:20.580
A sword? Am I a sword?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.620
Oh, you're finally awake.

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:25.380
Who is it?

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:28.750
You have a long road ahead of you,
so best of luck.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.420
What?

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:32.420
Well, see you around.

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:36.210
What? Hey! Wait!

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:40.540
That would be a loud hallucination if it were one.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.750
But to reincarnate as a sword...

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.830
No. Wait.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:51.580
Characters who are reborn
into a fantasy world get super powers, right?

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.920
Maybe I gained new abilities too.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:57.170
Appraisal!

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.420
NAME: UNKNOWN, WIELDER: NONE

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:00.880
(TYPE: INTELLIGENCE WEAPON)
Intelligence Weapon.

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:03.580
Let's see...

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.790
Skills, Self-Recovery and Telekinesis.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:09.080
Appraisal level six.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:11.790
Does this mean I am a powerful sword?

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:16.420
Based on my appearance,
I look like a legendary weapon

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:18.750
that only appears at a crucial moment in RPGs...

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:21.960
Hey!

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:23.880
(NAME: GOBLIN LEADER)
A gob... goblin!

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:26.000
(TYPE: WICKED)
Is he trying to pull me out?

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.080
What? No!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.670
I don't want to be used by goblins!

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:30.750
Me? Possibly a legendary weapon?

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:35.170
Hey, hey. You guys are certainly daft...

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.290
You... Very well.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:42.540
This is a declaration of war.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:45.170
I'll show you!

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.920
Oh, I can move using Telekinesis!

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.750
Take this!

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.540
I thought I would feel bad killing something...

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:05.750
Huh?

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.670
I feel a sense of accomplishment.

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:11.580
Is it because I performed a sword's duty?

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.880
I lit up again.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:22.040
MEMORY SKILLS: DIGGING 1, DISMANTLING 1,
SWORD ART 1, CLUBBING 1, LEADERSHIP 1

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.080
(SURVIVAL 1, KOBOLD KILLER)
My stats increased.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.670
(CRYSTAL EXP: 3/100, MEMORY: 10)
Crystal experience?

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:30.000
I lit up thrice, and I have three crystal exp.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.540
And then there's "memory".

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.250
What is this "memory skill"?

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:39.830
So the skill I used to slay those goblins increased.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:42.920
That means I absorbed something
from them and increased my stats!

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:46.250
Your current memory is 10.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.540
What?

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:48.830
Who are you?

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.500
Am I the only one who can hear you?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.710
Would you like to set your skills?

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:54.750
Huh?

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.540
Yes! I would like to set my skills!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.500
SET SKILL: DIGGING 1, DISMANTLING 1, SWORD
SWORD ART 1, CLUBBING 1, LEADERSHIP 1

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.620
(SURVIVAL 1, KOBOLD KILLER)
Crystals and skills...

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:03.080
I have some qualms,

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.710
but let's give it a try.

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:08.790
Stab!

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:12.380
Here it comes!

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:15.790
Oh, the sensation of eating something on a hungry stomach!

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:19.250
(MEMORY SKILL: VIGILANCE, POISON RESISTANCE)
Oh, new skills!

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.960
As expected, I can gain new skills by crushing the crystals.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.380
(ACTIVATE SKILL: DIGGING)
Thank you for the meal.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.790
But a sword without a wielder

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:35.080
is lonely.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.620
But now, I have a new goal.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.290
To collect skills!

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:42.620
I've reincarnated as a sword.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:45.960
For my future wielder, I want...

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:48.000
to become stronger.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.380
You're moving too slow, you useless thing!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:56.620
I want to become stronger...

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.500
Don't slack off!

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.790
Useless Black Cat.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.460
If only I had the power...

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.750
If I had the power...

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.380
I want power...

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.830
Power...

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:29.460
I consume mana when I use Telekinesis.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:30.500
(NAME: AIR FLOATER)
I can move

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.120
(SPECIES: BEAST, MAGICAL PLANT, LV: 5)
for up to three minutes at a time.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.210
I will be taking your crystal!

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:37.830
Gross!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.460
(MP)
My mana is being drained!

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:41.710
This is bad!

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:43.290
But I want

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.000
this skill so badly!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.380
Yes!

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:51.210
(ACQUIRED SKILL: MANA DRAIN 1)
Acquired Mana Drain.

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:53.620
(KEEN EYE, FLOAT)
And... float?

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.250
By combining Float and Telekinesis,

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.540
I can fly five times as far as I was able to.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.460
I'm positive I can go even further

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.830
if I combine this with Mana Drain.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.330
Combine Float and Telekinesis...

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.830
Free Fall!

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.750
Crystal get!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.710
Thank you for the feast.

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:19.710
Self-Evo has been activated.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:23.540
(SELF-EVO, RANK 2)
10 Self-Evo points gained.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:25.750
At this rate, by continuing to absorb crystals,

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:29.170
I can become the most powerful sword in this world!

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:33.420
(POINT BONUS)
Oh, is this something like bonus skills?

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:35.830
(MANA INCREASE (MIN))
Would you like to use five Self-Evo points

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:39.040
to acquire Mana Increase (Min)?

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.460
Yes, please!

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:44.960
(POINTS: 5, MP: 400)
Mana has been slightly increased.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.460
Oh, it went up by 100!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:49.290
In that case, I want Attack Increase (Min) too.

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:53.460
(POINT: 0, ATK: 212)
Attack has been slightly increased.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.120
It went up by 50!

00:06:56.120 --> 00:07:00.000
I'm sure my wielder would be delighted too!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.290
Oh, but I don't have one.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.420
I'm so lonely, PA.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.290
I'm doing a good job, aren't I?

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:10.710
Can't you praise me every now and then?

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:18.830
I've discovered the goblin's lair.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.620
Wipe out the goblins and take their crystals!

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:27.040
Thank you for the crystals.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:28.960
That's right.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:32.460
Goblins possess a wide variety of skills,
so they're exceptionally delicious.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.290
SKILL ACTIVATED: STEALTH

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.960
(NAME: GOBLIN KING)
Bingo.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.670
Here I go!

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:45.120
Telecatapult!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.210
Oh, dear. I overdid it.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:56.540
They must not have expected a sword to move on its own.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:59.290
(NAME: GOBLIN MAGE)
My real target is actually you.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.670
Crystal absorb! Kobold Amitabha!

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:10.170
(SKILL ACQUIRED: FIRE MAGIC 3)
This is it! The fire magic I've always wanted!

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.710
There's certainly a lot to be gained from goblins.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:18.330
(SWORD ART 3)
My Sword Art is up to level 3.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:23.880
So if I absorb a crystal of a skill
I already have, I can increase its mastery.

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.250
At this rate,

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:28.960
my wielder will instantly become
a fine swordsman the moment they equip me.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.210
I'm looking forward to it!

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.620
I'm sure my wielder will be surprised when they find me.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.000
You reek! I told you to shut up!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.290
Don't open that trap of yours again.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.960
What are you trying to do, Black Cat?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.500
Bow down!

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:58.380
You attempt to resist even when you're so pathetically weak.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.830
Black Cat,

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:02.830
as punishment, no food for you.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:08.710
Too slow!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.750
Hurry up and load the cargo!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.040
I'm already doing that.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:15.540
No talking! You all stink!

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:18.210
A pathetic species that can't even evolve.

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:21.620
The nerve of you to look at me like that!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.380
D... Down!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.920
You can't even resist or fight back.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.500
That's your place.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.250
I will become strong...

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:44.790
I must evolve...

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:52.420
This sword holder sets me at ease.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:55.830
(AREA 1 TO 5)
Now, then. For some reason,

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.540
(NAME: LESSER WYVERN)
the further the areas from this position,

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:00.120
(SPECIES: BEAST, LESSER WYVERN)
the stronger the monsters.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.120
No way!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.040
Even a lesser wyvern is still a dragon.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:07.460
The higher their levels,
the more crystal exp I gain from defeating them.

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.290
SKILLS: INTIMIDATION 2, STEALTH 2,
FIRE RESISTANCE 3, AIRFLOW MANIPULATION 3

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.330
POISON RESISTANCE 3, SCALE HARDEN,
ENHANCED SMELL, ENHANCED ABSORPTION, ENHANCED SIGHT

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.960
Self-Recovery!

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:18.710
I've gained all sorts of skills and abilities.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:23.420
To the point where I can
defeat monsters in Area 4 with ease.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:25.540
Then...

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.620
I'm sure I can do it now.

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:32.460
The boss of the south in Area 5.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.620
(GLUTTON SLIME KING)
The Glutton Slime King!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.540
That was close!

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:45.420
This isn't good.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:49.460
I need to take it down
in one go in the shortest time possible.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.880
Skill: Beastiary.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.420
(POSITION OF CRYSTAL: IN THE CORE OF ITS BODY)
All right. Located the crystal.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.920
Let's give it a try.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:04.290
Combining Telecatapult and Wind Shooter using wind magic.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:07.620
The strongest move I can use at the moment,

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.830
﻿Shuntensatsu!

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:26.750
If my wielder were here,
the damage might've been more than this.

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.960
I have to become stronger.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:31.750
Self-Evo activated.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:35.000
30 Self-Evo points gained.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.540
(SELF-EVO, RANK 6)
Speak of the devil!

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:40.960
(SKILL ACQUIRED: INSTANT REGENERATION 1)
Instant Regeneration?

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:43.830
Incredible!

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.750
It consumes a significant amount of mana,

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:48.040
but I can instantly regenerate my body!

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.290
This is a very useful skill.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:53.170
Next, Dimensional Storage.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:59.880
In other words, a dimensional pocket?

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:02.210
That's Area 5 for you.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:08.420
(DOPPEL SNAKE)
Next, I went after the boss of the east, the Doppel Snake.

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:10.670
(DOPPELGANGER)
I didn't really know what to do with its doppelganger,

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:12.920
(POISONOUS FANG, PARALLEL THOUGHT)
but it was a surprisingly easy win.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:16.580
The Doppelganger skill proved to be weaker than I thought.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:19.540
And for some reason,
the double can only appear in nude form.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:24.670
Next, the north.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.460
(BLAST TORTOISE)
Let's fight and evolve!

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.920
Skill, Parallel Thought!

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:39.710
I'll use the evo points to level up my earth magic.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:40.830
EARTH MAGIC 4

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:42.670
All right! Let's do this!

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.960
Earth Wall!

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:48.380
And Shuntensatsu!

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:52.210
Crystal absorb!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.790
(SKILLS: AIR COMPRESSION, AIR CANNON)
Thank you for the meal.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.000
Let's continue tomorrow.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:01.710
THE BOSS OF THE WEST, TYRANT SABER TIGER

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:05.960
It can move about in mid-air!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.540
Does it have any weaknesses?

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:12.460
That's it!

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:15.120
Use 15 Self-Evo points.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.750
Evolve Poisonous Fang into Magic Poisonous Fang.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:21.170
(POISONOUS FANG, MAGIC POISONOUS FANG)
This thing has a low poison resistance.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:24.830
But abnormally high defense stats.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:26.790
I'll have to poison it bit by bit.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:29.580
After hours of attacking...

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.080
I win!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.460
Self-Evo activated.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:36.880
All right!

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.250
(NAME: UNKNOWN, WIELDER: NONE)
Good.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.830
(TYPE: INTELLIGENCE WEAPON)
My stats went up.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.960
(SELF-EVO, RANK 7)
The evolution restored all my stats.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:45.750
I have defeated all enemies on these plains.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:50.120
To search for stronger beasts to defeat,
I shall...

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:54.380
advance towards the forest region beyond Area 5!

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:02.120
It doesn't seem
like there are powerful monsters in this area.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.500
Nothing appears out of the ordinary here.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.040
I suppose I'll fly elsewhere...

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:15.000
That's odd. I can't use Telekinesis.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.880
In that case, Vibration Fang!

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.620
Air Cannon!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.080
Fire Arrow!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:22.960
Wait a second... Hey!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:27.670
Every skill I use is absorbed by the ground!

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:31.210
You must be kidding me...

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:32.750
THREE DAYS LATER

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.920
This forest drains not only my mana
but also prevents it from recovering.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:39.120
Is that why there are no beasts here?

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:43.750
Maybe a beautiful elf warrior will
happen to pass by and rescue me.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:44.750
TEN DAYS LATER

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.380
I don't mind if it's not a humanoid anymore.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.380
Kobolds, zombies, anything.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:51.040
Someone, please pull me out!

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:53.920
(ONE MONTH LATER)
Anyone!

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:56.080
Please pick me up!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.290
I am a treasure to behold!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.880
I'm a magic sword equipped with tons of skills!

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:02.670
I can cook too!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.830
If it's necessary, I can use my points!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.880
Cooking skill has been increased to level 10.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.250
Bonus stats applied for the cooking skill.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:14.920
I can dismantle too! Look! Level 10 Dismantling!

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.880
I have level 7 Sword Art and level 7 Sword Technique!

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:19.620
If you need, I can level up my Fire Magic too!

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:21.880
Fire Magic has been increased to level 10.

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.830
New skill gained. Flame Magic 1.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.580
That's not all! I have Appraisal too!

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.000
I can increase that skill mastery!

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.460
There are many other things I can do too!

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:34.170
Moderate increase in wielder stats.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:40.210
If you wield me, you will become super strong!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.120
Despite becoming a powerful sword,

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:48.420
am I going to rust and wither away
before even being put to use?

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.290
This can't be...

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:54.790
Anyone... please...

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.250
Anyone... draw me...

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:59.500
Get it off our tail!

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.290
We... we can't!

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.210
Get them to carry the goods back!

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:14.790
Hurry up!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.580
A Twin-Headed Bear!

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.460
Do not run!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:23.710
All of you will be bait to buy us time!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:26.120
- That's awful...
- No, I don't want to die! Help!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:31.120
Am I going to die?

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.330
I don't want to die!

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.290
Now's my chance to run...

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:38.540
Move!

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:42.500
Wait...

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:46.880
I can move.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:48.460
- I can move now. - Run!

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:50.250
Move, black cat!

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:56.750
I won't die...

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:10.790
Will I die?

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.750
Use me.

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.250
I can't die...

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:16.420
Use me!

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:19.120
I want to become strong!

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.170
A sword...

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.250
No...

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.460
I want strength.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:36.330
I will give you power!

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.380
That sound...

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:39.420
Can you hear me?

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:42.620
So I can use Telepathy
to communicate upon contact?

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:43.830
Who are you?

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:44.960
I am the sword

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.670
you are about to draw.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:49.920
I'm shocked.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:52.580
You don't look like it.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:54.170
I am.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:57.710
Is she emotionally stunted?

00:17:57.710 --> 00:18:01.290
Never mind the details. Pull me out, Mofumimi!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:03.000
Got it.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.540
Hurry!

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:12.120
Please... Come on...

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.750
I'm out!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:18.960
What a beautiful sword.

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.460
Thank you.

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:23.080
But now's not the time for this.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.290
Can you fight?

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.380
A little.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.540
NAME: NAMELESS, AGE: 12,
SPECIES: BEASTKIN, BLACK CAT

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.330
(SKILL: SWORD ART 1)
You do only know the basics.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.210
But that's all right.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.670
Equip me.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:32.880
I have.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:36.080
You need a stronger will to equip me properly.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.580
Understood.

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:40.000
Nameless has been registered as wielder.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:43.880
Through skill sharing,
nameless has obtained the following skills.

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:48.380
Sword Art 7, Sword Technique 7, Fire Magic 10...

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:49.880
Amazing.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:52.580
I will help you become strong!

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:53.500
Now, go!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:54.620
I'm going to attack.

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:59.120
Amazing!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:08.250
I feel like a warrior that has slain countless beasts!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.080
Sword Art 7

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.080
and increased stats.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.420
There's no chance of us losing.

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.460
Mofumimi, slay that beast!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.210
You must attack with a strong will!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:18.920
Got it.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.710
Good girl.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.960
Look. You did it.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.420
All thanks to you.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:37.040
That's right. You should be grateful.

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.920
Thank you.

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:43.080
Wait! Why don't you take me with you?

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:44.620
But...

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.920
You'll probably be taken away...

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:50.040
Only one survived.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:53.790
We shouldn't have passed through
the Wilted Forest, after all.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.880
What should we do? Maybe you should just run away.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:59.420
As long as I bear this collar, I cannot defy him.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:02.290
I've tried escaping several times,
but it all ended in failure.

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.880
The collar...

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.000
Where did you get that sword?

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.250
Were you the one who defeated that monster?

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:10.920
Don't move!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.380
Hand over that sword.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:14.250
No!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:16.960
As long as I have your slave contract

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:22.000
and that collar, your fate lies in my hands...

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:26.120
Using Telekinesis... Fire Arrow!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.920
Good! I can use my skills again!

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.620
The collar...

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.920
Now, now. Calm down.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.580
I am calm.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:41.830
That is true.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:43.960
Perhaps too calm.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.330
Thank you.

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:53.750
I... I would like it if you could be my wielder.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:57.710
Would you be willing to wield me?

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:00.880
No, huh? As expected.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:03.080
Yes, I would be honored to!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:06.880
But it might be dangerous for you to travel with me.

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:11.040
I must become stronger.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.540
Is there a reason why you must?

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:17.420
No Black Cat has ever been able to evolve.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.540
Your kind?

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.670
That's why I wish to evolve.

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:27.540
It's a wish my parents were never able to fulfil.

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:28.920
I see...

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:32.880
A valiant purpose! I understand!

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:35.300
I will train you and make you strong.

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:37.420
I will see to it that you evolve!

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:39.330
Do you mean it?

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.580
Yes.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:42.790
Um...

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:44.620
By the way, what is your name?

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:47.500
My name was taken from me when I was enslaved.

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:49.750
What was your name before you were taken, then?

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:54.750
Fran...

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:57.540
Fran.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:01.790
Then, your name shall be Fran.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:02.830
Is that all right?

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:03.580
Is that no good?

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:05.170
No, of course, it's fine.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.330
I'm Fran.

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:09.290
You are pleased, yes?

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:12.750
What do I call you?

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:14.330
Huh? Me?

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:16.620
My name, huh?

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:19.500
Do you not have one?

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:20.290
That's right.

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:22.420
I'll give you one then.

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:24.120
Well, I guess that would be fine

00:22:24.120 --> 00:22:26.290
since you are my wielder.

00:22:32.290 --> 00:22:34.120
I've decided on your name.

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.460
Teacher.

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:38.210
T... Teacher? Why?

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:41.500
You said you would train me and make me stronger.

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:43.120
So you are my teacher.

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:45.580
Name has been set to "Teacher".

00:22:45.580 --> 00:22:48.040
No way! It has already been set?

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:49.080
Seriously?

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:50.460
Do you not like it?

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:54.120
Of course not.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:56.120
That's a great name!

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:02.790
And thus,

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:07.120
we embarked on a quest to help Fran evolve.

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:09.170
Teacher...

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:11.290
I want to become stronger...

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:13.040
Strong...

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:16.580
She'll attract a lot of attention when she grows up.

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:18.960
No! I won't allow that!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:21.330
If anyone wants to get to Fran,

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:24.210
they'll have to go through me first!

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:40.080
Next Episode: The Scary Examiner at the Adventurer's Guild
